    {
      "type": "worked-example",
      "id": 3,
      "prompt": "What does 'unbreakable' mean, using its parts (un + break + able)?",
      "solution": {
        "steps": [
          "'Un-' means not; '-able' means able to be.",
          "'Break' is the base.",
          "So 'unbreakable' means not able to be broken."
